    ],
    "difficulty": 3,
    "duplicateOf": null,
    "reviewNote": "Official key sqrt(3)/4+pi/6 is wrong (about 0.957; the solution computes an overlap area, never subtracts it from pi, and the overlap itself is miscomputed). Direct integration and numerics give 2*pi/3+sqrt(3)/4 (about 2.527), stored here.",
